// module = R134a_pTX_phX_all, log level = ERROR: [logStatusError][FMU status:Error] Modelica 4.1.0+maint.om/Media/R134a.mo:2599: Fluid state is too close to the two-phase region (p=3360[Pa], T=192.75[K]. Pressure and temperature can not be used to determine properties in two-phase region.
// module = R134a_pTX_phX_all, log level = ERROR: [logFmi2Call][FMU status:Error] fmi2CompletedIntegratorStep: terminated by an assertion.
